; Tutorial_4_Edit_and_Add_Records.inix -- changing a record and adding one.

[about]
Title=4 - Edit and Add Records
Intro=A cell edited with F2, a value picked from a list with Control plus F2, and a new record added with Control plus N.
Setup=JobTrail is open in DbDo.
Homework=Add a record of your own and fill three of its fields.

[step]

Say=One want: one job's status brought up to date, and a new job added.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Alt plus Control plus D, D for DbDo, opens it or brings it forward.
Key=Alt+Control+D
Hear=DbDo
Hear=DbDo ready

[step]

Say=I move to the status column of the record to change. F2 edits the cell under the cursor, as F2 renames a file in Windows.
Key=F2
Hear=status: edit
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=I type the new value and press Enter to keep it.
Key=Enter
Hear=(the record, with its new status)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Where a field has fixed values, Control plus F2 edits by picking one, so nothing is mistyped.
Key=Control+F2
Hear=status: list box
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Down Arrow to the value, and Enter.
Key=Enter
Hear=(the record, with the picked status)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Control plus N, N for New, adds a record to the table, and focus goes to its first field.
Key=Control+N
Hear=New record
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=I fill each field with F2 as before. Shift plus A, A for Added, says when this record was added.
Key=Shift+A
Hear=(the date and time the record was added)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=A planned misstep: Control plus D deletes a record, D for Delete, and asks first. Escape answers no.
Key=Control+D
Hear=Delete this record? No button
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Escape keeps it.
Key=Escape
Hear=DbDo
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=What this walk taught. I name the command; the reader gives the key.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Edit the cell I am on.
Key=
Hear=F2

[step]

Say=Edit by picking a value.
Key=
Hear=Control plus F2

[step]

Say=Add a record.
Key=
Hear=Control plus N
